      "writtenOn": "2023-09-11T07:06:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there going to be different networks (different ThreadNetworkController) with different versions at the same time ? I was wondering why this method is in ThreadNetworkController and not ThreadNetworkManager.",
      "revId": "ce660110becd244ab2251504f2a52884f01a050b",
