      "writtenOn": "2023-09-11T08:45:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Practically, I don\u0027t think there will be multiple versions at the same time. Even when hardware off-loading (e.g. ot-ncp-ftd) is supported, we should try to maintain the same version across multiple Thread chips and stacks / firmwares. But for off-loading, we won\u0027t be able to use a constant `THREAD_VERSION_1_3` as we do today, as the version needs to come from the core Thread stack (the c++ part).",
      "parentUuid": "730e47f9_2b887f30",
      "revId": "ce660110becd244ab2251504f2a52884f01a050b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
